{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Verkrachting en Troost, interview 09"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41811"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Het Kader"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Van Osch Filmprodukties ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"F.A.M. van Osch"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Van Osch Films"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De geïnterviewde vertelt dat ze door de Japanners gevraagd werd mee te gaan naar de kazerne. In tegenstelling tot haar vriendinnen, die bang waren, ging ze mee. Op de kazerne leerde ze onder andere de  Odori-dans. Ze moest zich kleden als een Japanse en voor de Japanners zingen en dansen. De Japanners genoten daarvan. Ook werd ze verkracht."}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De interviews voor dit project werden gevoerd in het Bahasa of Javaans en zijn in het Nederlands ondertiteld."}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Troostmeisjes"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Comfort women"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gedwongen prostitutie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oorlogsgetroffenen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oorlogsslachtoffers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oorlogsmisdaden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oorlogstrauma's"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ontvoeringen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Forced prostitution"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"War traumas"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","Indonesian","Javanese"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-11-08"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hilde Janssen (interviewer)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Frank van Osch (regie en camera)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sophie Tooten (geluid)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-08-16"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-11-08"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"'Troostmeisjes' worden ze genoemd. Jonge vrouwen, soms nog kinderen, die tijdens de Tweede Wereldoorlog stelselmatig werden verkracht door de Japanse bezetter in voormalig Nederlands-Indië. In soldatenbordelen verrichtten ze seksuele 'dwangarbeid'. Wat zijn de herinneringen van deze vrouwen en wat zijn de gevolgen geweest van hun verborgen en verdrongen leed?De filmmakers zijn in Indonesië op zoek gegaan naar vrouwen die als seksslavinnen moesten werken. Het heeft schoorvoetend vertelde levensverhalen opgeleverd vol pijn en schaamte. De verhalen zijn verwerkt in de documentaire 'Troostmeisjes'.Van de nu hoogbejaarde vrouwen zijn tevens portretfoto's gemaakt. Ook zijn hun verhalen verwerkt in een boek."}}]},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Tekstboek Schaamte en onschuld. Het verdrongen oorlogsverleden van troostmeisjes   \nuitgave Nieuw Amsterdam, ISBN 9789046807132  \n  \n(Nederlands\/Engelse) Fotoboek Troostmeisjes\/Comfort Women  \nIpso Facto Utrecht\/Seltmann+Söhne Lüdenscheid (Duitsland), ISBN 9789077386071"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelati